OL,3,CWarrington's Luke Littler honoured
OL,4,Cwith hometown mural
OL,6,FLuke Littler has been honoured with a
OL,7,Fmural in his hometown, marking another
OL,8,Fmilestone in the teenager's meteoric
OL,9,Frise.
OL,11,FWarrington darts sensation Littler
OL,12,Fsays he's "unbelievably happy" after a
OL,13,Fgiant mural of him was unveiled, but
OL,14,Fhas admitted he never imagined seeing
OL,15,Fhis own face on the side of a shopping
OL,16,Fcentre.
OL,18,FHe said: "Yeah, it's unbelievable. I
OL,19,Fdidn't think for one second I'd be up
OL,20,Fon a wall in my hometown, but yeah,
OL,21,FI'm very happy," Luke said.
OL,26,@tD@KOUtD@^O]zD@JOU}D@PO]
