OL,3,CWarrington's Luke Littler honoured
OL,4,Cwith hometown mural
OL,6,FLuke's grandma was among the first in
OL,7,Fthe family to see the mural.
OL,9,FHe said: "She was passing by on the
OL,10,Fbus and got off, spoke to the guys,
OL,11,Fand saw it before us."
OL,13,FLuke's focus extends beyond
OL,14,Fcelebrating his own success, he's
OL,15,Fcurrently donating darts equipment to
OL,16,F63 schools across Warrington, hoping
OL,17,Fto inspire the next generation.
OL,26,@qD@JOUsD@VO]
