CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785503910
OL,3,CWarrington's Luke Littler honoured
OL,4,Cwith hometown mural
OL,6,FLittler said: "This town means
OL,7,Feverything, and now it's all about
OL,8,Fgiving back. We're trying to get as
OL,9,Fmany youngsters into darts as we can."
OL,11,FReflecting on his rapid rise to fame,
OL,12,FLuke admitted, "At first, it was
OL,13,Fdefinitely a bit weird getting
OL,14,Frecognised. I was just thinking, 'I
OL,15,Fonly play darts. I only got to the
OL,16,Ffinal.'"
OL,18,F"But ever since then, I've been doing
OL,19,Fso well for myself, and this is why
OL,20,Fthese great things happen."
OL,26,@nD@OOUtD@POU|D@[O]
