OL,3,CWarrington's Luke Littler honoured
OL,4,Cwith hometown mural
OL,6,FDespite the admiration from fans, many
OL,7,Fof whom turned out to see him and get
OL,8,Fautographs, Luke has faced boos too.
OL,10,FHe said: "You've just got to get on
OL,11,Fwith it sometimes, whether people
OL,12,Fcheer you or boo you.
OL,14,F"Even at the Matchplay, people were
OL,15,Fbooing me, and then as soon as I hit
OL,16,Fthe nine-darter, everyone was cheering
OL,17,Fme. They're fickle. But you've just
OL,18,Fgot to let your darts do the talking."
OL,26,@rD@JOUzD@fO]
