OL,3,CWarrington's Luke Littler honoured
OL,4,Cwith hometown mural
OL,6,FWith a string of major titles already
OL,7,Fto his name and more in his sights,
OL,8,FLuke is as hungry as ever.
OL,10,FSpeaking of his recent form and
OL,11,Fsuccess, Littler said: "The clean
OL,12,Fsweep is definitely on. Everyone knows
OL,13,FI've got to go to Leicester and
OL,14,Fpotentially Holland if I win the World
OL,15,FSeries.
OL,17,F"If I was to win every major in a
OL,18,Fyear, then I've got to do it all over
OL,19,Fagain next year" he joked.
OL,26,@sD@XOU{D@PO]
