FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785503910
OL,3,CWarrington's Luke Littler honoured
OL,4,Cwith hometown mural
OL,6,F"There are still so many records left
OL,7,Fto be broken. Phil Taylor's in-game
OL,8,Faverage hasn't been beaten yet. As
OL,9,Flong as I play well, the trophies come
OL,10,Fwith it, and then the money follows."
OL,12,FThe mural's declaration, "Born to
OL,13,FWin," seems to sum up this rising
OL,14,Fstar's attitude perfectly.
OL,16,FWant more on the issues affecting the
OL,17,FNorth? Our podcast, From the North
OL,18,Fanswers the questions that matter to
OL,19,Four region.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@eO]tD@ZOUuD@EO]
